id: tp-03-spiral
number: 103
name: The Coil
description: The centre is three tiles away and eleven steps away. Ranged fire ignores the walls; the Stalker inside the corridor does not.
design: Board topology 3 — concentric rings, offset gates.
design: Outer ring, wall ring, middle ring, wall ring, one centre cell. The two gates are spikes, so every layer costs blood to enter. There is no line of sight in this game: a bow crosses the coils that a body has to walk around.
retired: Its central claim — the centre Lobber never leaves — was falsified by D-029. The Stalker never acts.

spawn h = Husk
spawn s = Stalker
spawn g = Grappler
spawn l = Lobber

roster a: Archer, Threadcaster
roster b: Vanguard, Wardbearer

